Description: Open-source software for pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic
    simulation, intended to make pharmacokinetics accessible to facilitate
    perioperative patient care, teaching, and research. Calculates and plots
    predicted plasma and effect-site concentrations for intravenous and
    extravascular anesthetics using analytical closed-form three-compartment
    solutions. May be freely downloaded and used without restriction for
    non-commercial purposes.
